# Dev-only key matching backend's DEV_API_KEY. Anthropic/production note: this
# is a first-party key for our OWN backend (not an upstream NSE credential),
# but it is still visible in browser JS via Vite's import.meta.env. That's
# fine for local development. Before shipping to real users, replace this
# with a per-session token minted server-side (e.g. a Supabase Edge Function
# that holds the real AfriFinance Data API key and issues short-lived,
# rate-limited tokens to signed-in app users) — see docs note in
# app/src/api/client.ts for the exact spot to swap this in.
VITE_AFRIFINANCE_API_KEY="dev-local-only-key"